{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X 在 S11、S13 这类较短停留段仍然偏密，而且话语切分较碎，连续读出因果关系不如 Y 顺畅。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的【】能让人迅速抓住每段心理支点，感受又按音乐小节分批出现，不必一次消化所有文字，边听边扫仍能跟上。更重要的是，X 保留了从怀念亲近、委屈反扑、害怕孤独，到逐渐接受矛盾并带着想念继续生活的细微变化，音乐感受也有具体的时间和层次。Y 的完整句子在因果解释上更顺，但右栏不少感受变成并列标签，削弱了情绪转折与音乐细节之间的对应关系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "751c2be0-38df-4ffe-9ffc-392d4e8e789a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T194117200508Z", "elapsed_seconds": 218.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:44:55.459656+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a3474ecb365517f6838ff23809ebaa731395c5bfdc9b23385b4f7cc3e97b7b49", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py